{"id":886,"slug":"the-red-balloon","title":"The Red Balloon","year":1956,"country":"France","duration":34,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/886-the-red-balloon","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/cff3315eb97f1e00f285b59af47c36db/NXL7Aj7DIjH9ayrp1f2miNZ6Aceaml_large.jpg","description":"Rarely has the spirit of childhood been evoked as exquisitely as in this Academy Award–winning cinematic fable, a fantasy with the texture of reality. On the streets of 1950s Paris, a young boy (played by director Albert Lamorisse’s son, Pascal) is launched on a miraculous adventure when he’s playfully pursued by a shiny red balloon that seems to have a mind of its own—until the harsh realities of the world interfere, setting the stage for a deeply moving finale. Shot in beautifully muted Technicolor, this beguiling allegory of innocence and transcendence has inspired generations of viewers to let their imaginations take flight.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Albert Lamorisse","slug":"albert-lamorisse"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Pascal Lamorisse","role":"Pascal","slug":"pascal-lamorisse"},{"actor":"Georges Sellier","role":"Featuring","slug":"georges-sellier"},{"actor":"Wladimir Popof","role":null,"slug":"wladimir-popof"},{"actor":"Paul Perey","role":null,"slug":"paul-perey"},{"actor":"Renée Marion","role":null,"slug":"renee-marion"},{"actor":"Sabine Lamorisse","role":null,"slug":"sabine-lamorisse"},{"actor":"Michel Pezin","role":null,"slug":"michel-pezin"},{"actor":"Renaud Séchan","role":null,"slug":"renaud-sechan"},{"actor":"David Séchan","role":null,"slug":"david-sechan"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Albert Lamorisse","slug":"albert-lamorisse"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Albert Lamorisse","slug":"albert-lamorisse"},{"role":"Director of photography","person":"Edmond Séchan","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Maurice Le Roux","slug":null},{"role":"Sound","person":"Pierre Vuillemin","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","p